window.products.push({"id":745078,"name":"WEN 300-Pound Capacity Chrome-Plated Shop Bar Stool","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":61.71,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CqFq5wbLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Remember when you could sit down? Sitting has been one of America’s most beloved pastimes, second only to laying. WEN celebrates this age old tradition with the WEN 300-pound capacity chrome-plated bar stool. The padded vinyl cushion measures in at 14-1/2 inches in diameter and 3-3/4 inches thick. It’s swiveling function rotates the cushion a full 360 degrees, allowing users to face over 360 directions. At a height of 29 inches, The WEN 300-pound capacity is at the perfect size for any countertop, whether it be at the garage or the wet bar. The chrome-plated body fights rust and corrosion while the single ring footrest helps alleviate the weight of your own legs. And because this is a WEN product. a nationwide network of skilled service technicians and a friendly customer help line all to make sure you remember WEN.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CqFq5wbLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WEN","source_asin":"B082MCJ7ZC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-745078","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082MCJ7ZC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082MCJ7ZC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":745079,"name":"La Mongoose Acacia Wood Leaf Shape Serving Platter 14 x 9 with Grooves & Handle. Luxury Snack Paddle Large XL Reversible Tray for Dinner Parties Chips","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81G-81t7puL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LA MONGOOSE ACACIA WOOD LEAF SHAPED CHEESE AND CHARCUTERIE SNACK PLATTER - Makes serving and eating snacks the enjoyable experience it should be.Made from the finest, quality, natural, sustainable premium, organic, eco-friendly acacia wood .Features a selection of grooves, useful for presenting a range of different snack options.Makes a fantastic gift and a stunning centerpiece at your next gathering.Treated with natural food oils to remain safe to use, this platter is hygienic and clean , whether your food is warm or cold.Consistent durability for a lifetime of use, will not crack or warp like cheaper products.Use this as a sophisticated serving tray at your next dinner party or social gathering.From hors d'oeuvres, nachos and guacamole, hummus and crudités, to charcuterie, fruit, cold meats, bread sticks and cheeses… whatever you want! This platter is multi-functional , has all the space you could ever need, and brings sophistication to your dining table or dinner party.Makes an exceptional gift for a wedding, birthday, hostess or housewarming party, or simply something to keep for yourself. Modern and sophisticated , our snack paddle will give your kitchen and dining room an elegant touch.The platter is 14 inches long, 9 inches wide, and has a long handle with a helpful hole to allow you to hang it up when not in use.Please note: do not put in the dishwasher; we only recommend cleaning by hand as it's made from natural wood.As with all La Mongoose products, sourcing environmentally friendly materials is very important to us. This product comes in superior, eco-friendly packaging - good for your kitchen, good for the environment! La Mongoose - Adore la Vie de Paris","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81G-81t7puL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"La Mongoose","source_asin":"B0B3XT5XV5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-745079","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3XT5XV5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3XT5XV5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
