window.products.push({"id":745089,"name":"SIXTREES 4 Pack Set 8X10 Inch Wood Deep Picture Frames, Adds Depth with Contrast Color, Pre-Attached Mounting Hooks Wall Hanging, Or Standing Easel Ta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y8UHVNBWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"\" PREMIUM WHITE & GRAY, GRAY & WHITE, BLACK & SILVER, GRAY, BLACK 8X10 WALL FRAMES THAT CAN BE HUNG UP  - OR - PLACED ON A TABLETOP DESK WITH AN EASEL Hang your pictures up - as our frames feature built-in mounting hooks on the back for hanging on a wall. We included pre-attached mounting hooks on both sides of the back of the frame, so that you can choose to hang them vertically as a portrait, or horizantally as a landscape format effect. Sixtrees 8X10 frames feature an optional sturdy desktop easel for displaying your photos for tabletop and desk display. UNIQUE SHAPE OF WOODEN MOULDING ADDS DEPTH AND DIMENSION TO YOUR PHOTOS The shape of the molding presents eye-catching detail, in that matting is not needed as the frame moulding itself turns inwards toward your photo. <b> Frames do not feature white matting, instead the moulding of the frame slopes inwards, creating a convex shape that highlights the photo you insert in your frame.  See above images to notice this detail. Pictures are worth more than a thousand words, make sure you cherish your memories proudly with a poster frame that is matted to your picture. CHOOSE FROM WHITE OR BLACK OR GREY 8X 10 INCH DESIGNER FRAMES Place your loving memories, cellphone photos, or art within these designer wood frames featuring real glass. Buy photo frames in bulk as a 2pack or 4 packs sets for superior value.We do not use plexiglass - as our gallery frames are constructed from the highest quality material. Truly beautiful frames subtly enhance your pictures - but instead enhance the presentation of what you value and want to highlight.As you already know, Instagram and mobile phone photos are appreciated, look best, and are remembered best in mat frames and not on screens. \"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y8UHVNBWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SIXTREES","source_asin":"B07MVN7H3G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-745089","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MVN7H3G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MVN7H3G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
