window.products.push({"id":745097,"name":"Digging Dolls Specimens: Exceptional Amethyst Geodes from Uruguay - 1.5 lb to 2 lbs - B Grade - Amethyst Stone Rock Specimen for Arts, Crafts, Home Dé","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MvnLuc32L._AC_SL1012_.jpg","description":"The Digging Dolls Brand of stones is owned by female rock hounds who care deeply about providing only the best quality and value with the most spectacular stones on the market. When you order any authentic Digging Dolls product you can be certain that every order has been through a rigorous quality control process and only the best products are allowed to feature our Digging Dolls logo.These exceptional Amethyst Geodes from Digging Dolls have been hand selected and graded one piece at a time by our expert minerologists who have over 120 combined years experience in the gem and mineral industry. A six point checklist is used to individually grade every single specimen into 5 different categories including from highest to lowest SE (Special Extra), EX (Extra), A (Grade 1), B (Grade 2), and C (Grade 3). This grading is crucial to ensuring that every piece has been carefully scrutinized for customers receive the highest quality available within each grade at the best possible price.There are two options when purchasing the Digging Dolls brand of amethyst geodes. The first is the least expensive which is purchasing a random piece which will be similar but not identical to those shown in our images. The second option is for the connoisseur who wants to select the exact piece they are purchasing so they know the exact shape and aesthetic beauty of their specific geode. While this option is not always available due to them selling out very quickly, when you see an option with a pull down menu on mobile, or boxes to click with individual piece numbers on a PC or Mac, those will be the individual pieces that you can hand select. You will see a number such as \"EX00125\" and when that is selected the piece you see in the picture will be the exact piece sent if ordered.These geodes are perfect for home decor, wedding decor, crystal healing or a gift for your favorite rock hound! We hope you enjoy our exclusive Digging Dolls specimen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MvnLuc32L._AC_SL1012_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Digging Dolls","source_asin":"B01N6RZUWI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-745097","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N6RZUWI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N6RZUWI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
