window.products.push({"id":745177,"name":"Handmade Italian Yellow Ceramic Basket 4” | Intrecci Collection by Modigliani – Small, Hand-Painted Ceramic Woven Home Décor Baskets | Perfect Italian","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Xlv+JusYL._AC_.jpg","description":"INTRECCI BASKET COLLECTION BY MODIGLIANI: Available in multiple colors and sizes, our Intrecci (which means “to weave”) Collection ranges in use from paper clip holder to large, woven planters. This small yellow, ceramic square bon bon basket measures just 4.75” in diameter & is handmade by Italian artisans and make the perfect decorative bowl to keep jewelry in or office supplies like paper clips. PERFECT DECORATIVE BASKET FOR THE HOME OR OFFICE: Put on display a beautiful work on handmade Italian craftsmanship to top off any dining room or kitchen table. Our “Bon Bon” basket (which means candy in Italian) is the perfect, small basket that you can used as a candy bowl for the office or office supplies on your desk! Make sure to decorate your table or home with our one-of-a-kind woven, ceramic basket! HANDMADE BY ITALIAN ARTISTS: Each of our ceramic basket are traditionally hand crafted by our skilled artisans in Italy. The Modigliani Intrecci Collection helps you bring the taste of Italian art into your home. Please note, the item you receive will not be the exact same as pictured due to each piece being hand crafted. Each small, ceramic bowl is an original work of art, uniquely hand-made by stay at home mothers who learned the craft from their mom! MIX & MATCH WITH OUR COMPLETE SET: Time to throw away that old fine China! Finally, decorative kitchen or office décor that you’ll be proud to use year round. Makes for the perfect gift for teachers or office assistants or like putting out treats. This Intrecci collection is sold separately and features multiple color options of Octagon, Oval & Square Woven, Ceramic Baskets, along with Ceramic Planters. SUPPORT TRADITION: Modigliani Italian ceramics strongly supports the tradition of passing down art from past four generation. All set pieces in this authentic ceramic fruit basket & planters collection were made by Italian artists that have learned classic ways of creating beautiful, functional art. Collect a piece of Italy and indulge your eyes with a natural basket set that is made to last and support the timeless tradition of handmade ceramics.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Xlv+JusYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modigliani","source_asin":"B00Y9GPY66","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-745177","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Y9GPY66","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00Y9GPY66","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
