window.products.push({"id":745315,"name":"Ticking Stripe Delightfill Chair Cushion and Lumbar Pillow Set (Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1Cw1ggcbOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Ticking Stripe Chair Cushion and Lumbar Pillow Set will bring comfort and style to your home. Its small stripe detail gives this set a country coastal look. The non-slip cushion is made with durable, upholstery-weight fabric and filled with DelightFill material for ultimate comfort. It is backed with a non-slip Gripper so the cushion stays in place without ties. The Lumbar pillow is perfect for giving your lower back extra support or to add a little cushion to an uncomfortable chair, works great in the office or in a wooden chair at home. Sold as a set. Chair not included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1Cw1ggcbOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gripper Cushion","source_asin":"B072XV7QSB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-745315","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072XV7QSB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072XV7QSB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
