window.products.push({"id":745344,"name":"Fruit And Vegetable Wash, Fruit And Vegetable Wash, Veggie Wash,Cordless Vegetable Washer Fruit Washer USB Rechargeable Portable Purifier Cleaner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718lzWuzRML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Feature:1. Effectively remove pesticide residues on the surface of vegetables and fruits, with a removal rate of 90%.2. Built-in 4400mAh rechargeable battery, USB wireless charging design, can be used 25 times when fully charged.3. IPX7 waterproof, no water leakage, safer to use.4. Compact design, easy to carry when going out for a picnic.how to use:1. Please charge it before use. While charging, the green light flashes. After charging, the green light is always on.2. Put the fruits and vegetables to be washed into the sink, and add water with a temperature not exceeding 40°C. It is recommended not to exceed 3L of water per word.3. Please put the fruit and vegetable washing machine at the bottom of the sink and keep it flat.4. During the working period of the fruit and vegetable machine, occasionally stir the fruit and vegetables, and the cleaning effect will be better.5. During the operation of the fruit and vegetable machine, the electrolyzed water smells of detergent, please rest assured, it is a normal phenomenon.6. After the fruit and vegetable machine is finished, there will be 3 beeps and all the indicator lights will go out. At this time, let the fruits and vegetables in the washbasin stand for 5-10 minutes to fully exert the electrolysis effect, and finally take out the fruits and vegetables with clean water. just rinse.Notice:1. It is forbidden to immerse the wireless charging stand in water, charge it on a table with an unstable tilt, and do not approach or place it on any electrical appliances.2. The charging stand is used together with the purifier, and it is prohibited to use other charging stands as supporting facilitiesCleaning and Maintenance:1. Please do no","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718lzWuzRML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZWJ","source_asin":"B09TB1FR25","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-745344","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TB1FR25","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TB1FR25","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":745345,"name":"Booze Cruiser® Cruise and Travel Flasks Great for Sneaking Alcohol Anywhere You Want a Rum Runner Cocktail (2x32oz, 2x16oz, 2x8oz + Funnel)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619MM5-6d1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Need to safely take your own drinks with you while on the go?  Want to save money on expensive cruise drinks? Then this Cruise Liquor Flask Kit is what you need! This is the only  flask kit you will ever need! Each Set Contains the Following: 2x32oz Flasks 2x16oz Flasks 2x 8oz Flasks 1x Funnel Stay undetected and store your booze. Now, you'll have everything you need to  easily sneak alcohol anywhere - into cruise ships, sporting events, concerts and  more! Enjoy a Drink Anywhere  They easily fit into your baggage so you can take your alcohol with you They're so  lightweight and flat and are easily stored when not in use.  Because they are non-metallic, they are undetectable by metal detectors and x ray scanners. Save Money on Drinks  Say goodbye to outrageous bar bills. No need to pay for crazy alcohol prices.  Simply take your alcohol, spirits, rum, scotch or vodka with you. Save your hard earned money. Using Booze Cruiser Flasks you are able to enjoy the same over priced beverages for a fraction of the cost. Works in All Places  These flasks are not just for cruises. Bring it while hiking, camping, concerts, sporting event ,golfing, in movie theatres, at the glass free beach or virtually anywhere you'd like to enjoy a beverage.  Perfect for all non-carbonated beverages like rum, wine, cocktails, spirits and  non-alcoholic drinks. What Sets Booze Cruiser Flasks Ahead of the Rest Our Cruise Flasks are made of the highest quality BPA free, food grade plastics available and manufactured in a clean, state of the art facility to ensure an excellent experience. They are extremely durable, yet pliable and lightweight so you can hide them anywhere!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619MM5-6d1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Booze Cruiser","source_asin":"B01L9OZZTG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-745345","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01L9OZZTG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01L9OZZTG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
