window.products.push({"id":745526,"name":"BLACK FRIDAY SPECIAL!! Sneak a Drink Cruise Flask Kit - Booze Liquor Bag Set - 4-Pack (1x32oz, 2x16oz, 1x8oz) Various Package Quantities Available - P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41dUqKZaEOL._AC_.jpg","description":"EXERCISE YOUR 21ST AMENDMENT RIGHT! During Prohibition, social drinkers were forced to resort to going to speakeasies where illegal alcohol was brought in from the Bahamas. Now that has all changed, and we can smuggle liquor ourselves! Double Black’s “Experts Only” Sneak a Drink Flask Kits make that job easier. Don’t pay high prices on your cruise ship or at sporting events just because it’s the only game in town. Use our hidden plastic flasks, to conceal your alcohol, and you can drink on the cheap on your travels! WHAT’S INCLUDED: ♦(1) 32oz, (2) 16oz, and (1) 8oz flasks♦(1) funnel for easy filling ♦The sense of pride when you have successfully cleared security! TAKE THEM ANYWHERE: These sneak flasks won’t just sustain you on your epic booze cruise, they can also come with you to tailgates, camping, concerts, the beach, pool parties (they float!) , Disney World, the mall, family dinners, wherever you might need a little pick me up.Mix and match with your favorite liquors or pre-mix your favorite cocktail. Save money on ice, throw them in the freezer and your flask will stay cold. Plus, our flasks are better value than rum runners. KIDS love them too for juice and water. Just sip on the flask like a straw! Eco-friendly design is great for DIY homemade juice packs. The Experts Only team wants you to have a great time, but we also want you to DRINK RESPONSIBLY! Take back your freedom and stop wasting money on expensive booze...Become an Expert and buy your flasks today! Cheers! Salud! Proost! Slainte! L’Chaim!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41dUqKZaEOL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Experts Only","source_asin":"B00XT7UBEG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-745526","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XT7UBEG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XT7UBEG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
