window.products.push({"id":745621,"name":"KLIFI™ Tabletop Ironing Board, Small Foldable Iron Board for Space Saving, Portable Folding Mini Ironing Board with Non-Sleep Feet, Iron Rest and Cove","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dW2Pf3dXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mini ironing board to BE IMPECCABLY PRESSED : at home, at university or while traveling with the KLIFI H&K Essentials Tabletop Ironing Board. Make a great first impression with your date or that all-important business presentation with a portable ironing board that folds to just 16.9” and fits in a closet, under your desk or even in your suitcase. It is a must-have addition to dorm room essentials and household items Miniture ironing board with SPACE-SAVING DESIGN : delivers big when you need to iron clothes in your tiny home, vacation RV or college dorm. Open and set up, the KLIFI Compact Ironing Board measures 32”L x 12”W x 4.5”H, perfect for a kitchenette countertop or study desk. Press pants, blouses, shirts and dresses with ease. Then fold the table ironing board to 16.9” and hang it from a closet rod or tuck it into a drawer. Countertop ironing board that is STURDY AND STABLE : folding ironing board is made of rugged tubular steel, impact-resistant ABS plastic, with a silicone iron rest pad and cotton covers with 5mm padding that are heat-resistant. Non-skid rubber feet help hold this small ironing board securely on glass, ceramic, laminate and wood surfaces so you can press your clothes easily, quickly and accurately at home and on the go. Foldable ironing board comes with 2 STYLISH COVERS : complement any decor. Elasticized for snug fit over our small iron board, these machine washable covers endure steam ironing and high heat pressing of cotton, wool, polyester and other fabrics. This table top ironing board with covers and pad is an indispensable addition to your first apartment must haves, tiny home essentials, dorm room essentials or travel accessories. Small ironing board with GIFT-READY PACKAGING that includes 2 interchangeable ironing board covers and a silicone iron pad make the KLIFI Mini Ironing Board an impressive housewarming gift or high school graduation gift. When your adult child leaves the nest, add this ironing table to their college supplies or new apartment essentials and rest assured that they will enter the professional world dressed for success.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dW2Pf3dXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KLIFI","source_asin":"B0BRMBHWD8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-745621","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRMBHWD8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRMBHWD8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
