window.products.push({"id":745777,"name":"Knife Set With Block Created 20 pcs Block Knives Set HOABLORN Chef's Set: AK01, Extra Cutting Board in a Luxurious Knife Holder, Big Value and Elegant","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wfY7y9ltL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️<b>Kitchen Knife Sets as Nice Gifts</b> :</p> Each knife is carefully forged, the wooden knife block is also patiently built. It is suitable not only for family kitchens, but also for chefs. What's more,the classical appearance is combined with Damascus patterns,all this in an beautiful display box.These make such an impressive gift for housewarming, wedding, Father's Day, Mother's Day Thanksgiving</p> ✔️Full Knife Sets with Block: AK01 20Pcs knife set includes 15pcs( 8\" chef's knife, 7.5\" cleaver knife ,8” bread knife,7\" santoku knife,6.5\" boning knife,5.5\" universal knife,5pcs 5.5\" serrated steak knife,a pair of kitchen scissors, a Knife sharpe and wooden knife block of Acacia ). Extra 5pcs Wine Opener Kit !(opener,thermometer,bottle ring, cork ,drain). ✔️<b> Stainless Steel Knives and Handles:</b><p> The whole knife is made of high carbon stainless steel.Whole knife using the overall forging process.Compared with the wooden handle, the wooden handles would have some problems such as falling off, loosening, and mildew.The one piece forgings are more durable stronger.In order to keep classic style, thickening wood grain resin is coated,which is environmentally friendly and makes the handles comfortable in the hand ! </p> ✔️Easy Care & Storage :Our knife block is made of acacia wood.I believe you will like its three-layer design. We used 7 pounds of wood, use a non-slip and hollow design, so it can keep the knives set dry and safe. At the same time, The acacia cutting board can be stored behind it,very convenient to use, and more importantly, it is also space saving.The cooking knife set needs hand clean and don't use dish washer. ✔️After-Sale Guarantee: Welcome to HOABLORN's store. We will provide quality after-sales service. If you have any questions, please contact us, our customer service is always available. HOABLORN has been focusing on kitchen gift sets for years, its big honor for us to witness your affection and love..","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wfY7y9ltL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOABLORN","source_asin":"B09KTS64NR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-745777","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KTS64NR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KTS64NR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
