window.products.push({"id":745794,"name":"Cutie Cups Unique Christmas Wine Glass Gift, 18.75 Ounce (Are We Merry Yet)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bRDRkzZhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ho ho ho! Santa needs your help picking a few funny wine glasses as Christmas gifts for the wine lovers in your life. Cutie Cups are cool Christmas mugs that make everyone's holiday a merry one with their funny design. Three times the size of regular stemware, these oversized wine glasses with sayings can hold three full glasses of wine. The back has three lines that mark one wine glass. This way, the recipient of your wine glasses and corkscrew gift set can choose to pour one glass for \"Hum-Bug,\" two for \"Almost There\" or three for \"Happy Holidays!\" The front of the wine cups says, \"Are We Merry Yet?\" as a hilarious final touch. These unique wine glasses make great: - Holiday gift wine glasses for mom, sisters, daughters, friends & more - Secret Santa gifts for coworkers and family - Funny gifts for coworkers, grab bags and gift exchanges - Stocking stuffers- For serving wine at a holiday party - Hostess gifts for holiday get-togethers and dinners - Gifts for any wine lover you know! The Cutie Cups Humorous Christmas Holiday Wine Glasses are the best choice of unique wine glass gifts on Amazon. They're: - MORE DURABLE. The wine cups' funny messages won't wear off over time and the glasses are chip resistant - SO MUCH EASIER TO CLEAN. Unlike many other wine glasses and accessories, Cutie Cups are dishwasher safe - BETTER QUALITY. Made in the USA! - READY FOR GIFTING. Glasses are securely packed in a gift box. Bring a little extra joy to the holiday season with the best quality Christmas wine glasses on Amazon! Order the Cutie Cups Humorous Christmas Holiday Wine Glass and get a free corkscrew!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bRDRkzZhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cutie Cups","source_asin":"B0165100HU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-745794","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0165100HU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0165100HU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
