window.products.push({"id":745935,"name":"Wall Towel Rack for Rolled Towels, Dscabomlg New Upgrade 3-Bar Towel Holders for Wall Mounted，Bathroom Towel Storage for Small Bathroom, Metal Bath To","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EqN0vQsNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【2nd Generation Towel Rack - New Upgraded 3-Bar Design】The Dscabomlg towel rack has been upgraded from a 2-bar to a 3-bar design. The three-bar towel design has a smaller gap in the middle, which can accommodate more towel sizes. The small towel will not fall off, and the large towel is more stable. 【Large Capacity Storage】Dscabomlg bathroom towel holder is 28.7'' length x 8.7'' width x 5.5'' distance from wall. This bathroom towel storage can hold up to 8 pcs of regular sized bath towels or 6 pcs of extra large bath towels. 【Towel Storage for Small Bathroom】Suitable for small places with insufficient space, making full use of the wall space and maximizing the towel storage space. Perfect for smaller bathrooms, RVs or zero cabinet towel storage. 【Additional Design】Added \"TOWELS\" logo hook in the middle. Not only does it add a stylish touch, but the hooks can also hang small items, etc.The hook is detachable, you can choose whether to install it or not according to your preference. 【Best Gift】Dscabomlg wall towel rack stores for rolled bath towels, hand towels, kitchen towels, pool towels, yoga towels, beach towels and so on. Perfect for guest bathrooms, master baths, RVs, campers, salons, saunas and more. The perfect housewarming gift for bathroom organization. 【Easy to Assemble】Wall-mounted punching holes for greater stability, towel rack comes with screws. Please follow the user manual to install. And there is an installation video attached to the product picture introduction.If any problems, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EqN0vQsNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dscabomlg","source_asin":"B0BMGLMLFC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-745935","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMGLMLFC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMGLMLFC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":745936,"name":"AUXSOUL Non-Slip Rug Grippers, 8 Pcs Reusable Washable Carpet Corner Pads, Double Sided Anti Curling Rug Underlay Stopper for Floors, Carpets, Mats an","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MZNTTmYCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"No more curved corners to spoil the beauty of your home. Now you can enjoy perfectly flat corners around the house Specification: Name: Carpet gripper Material: Silicone Size: 15.5x10.5cm(6.1*4.1in) Quantity: 8 Colour: Black Purpose: Prevent the floor from curling and sliding The package contains: 8 * Carpet gripper Warming Notes: 1.Due to manual measurement, there may be a slight error in size and weight. 2.Due to the difference between different monitors, the picture may not reflect the actual color of the item. 3. Remove the backing and paste the mat to the bottom of the carpet to be fixed. Then remove the film covering the silicon surface to firmly press the carpet on the floor","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MZNTTmYCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AUXSOUL","source_asin":"B08QZK5Y9L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-745936","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QZK5Y9L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QZK5Y9L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":745937,"name":"NOVICA Hand Carved Large Suar Wood Wall Mounted Relief Panel 'Baru Klinthing Dragon'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kR8p+nwjL._AC_SL1456_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer.  About this item: Masterfully carving Balinese suar wood, Seji Taram recalls the legend of the dragon, Baru Klinthing. He was born to a concubine of Ki Ageng Mangir II, a rebel, who would never accept a dragon as his son unless the creature could wrap its entire body around Mount Merapi. To accomplish this, Baru Klinthing had to use his tongue to reach his tail. The angry father cut off the dragon's tongue, which became a powerful spear and source of power.  - Signed by the artist - Wood grain and color can vary slightly - Intended as wall decor   About our Artist: 'I'll always remember what my husband said before died, he wanted me to carry on caring wisely for our children, and he also encouraged me to be a stronger woman for our children's sake. Now I continue his designs, as well as create my own new designs.'","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kR8p+nwjL._AC_SL1456_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B00G4R5M4M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-745937","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00G4R5M4M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00G4R5M4M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":745938,"name":"Nespresso C100/T1 Essenza Automatic Machine, Titan Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7116p6Im1CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Nespresso has developed a unique extraction system specially adapted to capsules. It controls every vital setting when preparing a perfect espresso. Nespresso machines have been designed with renowned partners and designers, and bring out the taste and aromas of coffee by combining quality of design with ease of use. The Nespresso C100 Essenza Automatic Machine is part of our compact line, which features a modern, compact, and practical design. The machine deploys technology essential for preparing an outstanding Espresso, and is exceptionally easy to use: Automatic control of the amount of coffee in the cup. A high pressure pump (19 bars) extracts all the aromas and develops a smooth crema in the cup. A thermobloc which heats water to 187°and 196° during extraction and empties the remaining water after each use so that the water is fresh for each preparation. A simple system which perforates the capsule and soaks all the ground coffee to optimally filter the coffee. A functional handle system, which allows for easy coffee preparation. Automatic ejection of used capsule. Removable water container (34 oz). Tray for used capsules. Back-lit control button","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7116p6Im1CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nespresso","source_asin":"B001K9HVHU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-745938","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001K9HVHU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001K9HVHU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
