window.products.push({"id":745984,"name":"iCrown(TM) Mini Portable Water Bottle Steam USB Humidifier Air Mist Diffuser Purifier Cap, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517Dk7rGk0L._AC_.jpg","description":"When it's too dry in a room, when humidification is necessary, use portable humidifier. It does a great job of putting out cool mist. It fits most bottle, but simply place the device on any bottles without screwing it on, still works! Compact enough to fit into your travel bag. Features: -Perfect on a desk and puts a fine mist into a small area about 15 square metres -This humidifier runs so quiet, will not disturb your sleep at night -Also work in car when connect with a car charger How to Use: 1. Soak the whole filter stick into the water COMPLETELY to absorb water first. 2. Insert it into the bottom of the \"cap\" thoroughly against the silver ATOMIZING FILM in the top of the nozzle. Two-thirds of the filter immerse in the bottle water will better the mist amount. 3. Plug a USB cord into the micro USB port on the side of the humidifier. The built-in Blue Light will be on. Notes: Please make sure you operate it in a proper way to get best effect of this humidifier. If no mist comes out, please check if filter is wet enough and if it touches the silver atomizing film 1. Each filter can work up to 3 months (more, if you regularly dry it). 2. The first time to use the unit, ,the mist amount will be less than 40ml/h,after second time to use it, it will work perfect. 3. Distilled or spring water is preferred. No tap-water. 4. It runs for up to eight hours before automatically turn off. Replug the power cable and add more water for restart. 5. If mist output decreases,pls make it close to the filter again or replace","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517Dk7rGk0L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iCrown","source_asin":"B00LIO0FYS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-745984","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LIO0FYS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LIO0FYS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
